WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.506
"Stay together, everyone," Vig whispered.

2
00:00:05.507 --> 00:00:11.194
He glanced at Zann. "And make sure that dragon of yours behaves himself."

3
00:00:11.195 --> 00:00:16.794
"What a grump," Zann said as the rebel leader hurried toward the front of the small group.

4
00:00:16.795 --> 00:00:20.705
"Yeah." Perda stifled a yawn.

5
00:00:20.706 --> 00:00:25.589
It was very early, and Zann and his friends had been up talking most of the night.

6
00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:30.714
Zann had told them everything he'd seen in the palace, including the machine in the courtyard.

7
00:00:30.715 --> 00:00:35.016
Everyone wondered if it was the magic-sucking machine Gliss had heard about.

8
00:00:35.017 --> 00:00:39.181
Now they were marching into Wormwood, ready to test Fala's plan.

9
00:00:39.182 --> 00:00:46.204
She had spent the entire night working on the troll talisman, identifying each of the spells Morb had placed on it.

10
00:00:46.205 --> 00:00:49.764
Then she had eliminated all of them, one by one.

11
00:00:49.765 --> 00:00:53.099
"Do you really think this will work?" asked Zann.

12
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:59.589
Fala looked at the talisman. "Infusing objects with a Remote Power spell is extremely difficult.

13
00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:03.976
But I learned from Teplo, and he's a master at it." Fala smiled.

14
00:01:03.977 --> 00:01:08.485
"Of course, until now I've only practiced on turnips."

15
00:01:08.486 --> 00:01:13.212
The group entered Wormwood. It was still early, and the whole place was quiet.

16
00:01:13.213 --> 00:01:15.947
None of the residents seemed to be awake yet.

17
00:01:15.948 --> 00:01:19.139
"Do you see any trolls?" Gliss whispered.

18
00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:22.817
"No," Perda said. "Maybe they're all sleeping."

19
00:01:22.818 --> 00:01:27.788
"I doubt it," Darb said. "Trolls don't sleep the way people do.

20
00:01:27.789 --> 00:01:31.031
They're not really smart enough to realize when they're tired.

21
00:01:31.032 --> 00:01:34.876
Trolls' brains just sort of shut down now and then throughout the day."

22
00:01:34.877 --> 00:01:36.687
Zann pointed. "Look!"

23
00:01:36.688 --> 00:01:40.291
Two trolls were emerging from behind a small group of huts.

24
00:01:40.292 --> 00:01:44.555
As soon as the trolls spotted Zann and Gliss, they charged toward them.

25
00:01:44.556 --> 00:01:48.160
A dull image of red hair floated above their heads.

26
00:01:48.161 --> 00:01:50.597
"Now!" Vig shouted.

27
00:01:50.598 --> 00:01:56.590
Fala held up the talisman, rubbing it between her hands. "Free!" she intoned.

28
00:01:56.591 --> 00:02:01.280
The trolls skidded to a halt, and the image of red hair disappeared.

29
00:02:01.281 --> 00:02:09.417
One troll looked at Zann, confused. The other troll let out a grunt—an image of troll gruel formed above its head.

30
00:02:09.418 --> 00:02:12.987
Soon the two trolls were searching the ground for food.

31
00:02:12.988 --> 00:02:17.922
When they didn't find any, they turned back toward Zann and began grunting angrily.

32
00:02:17.923 --> 00:02:22.080
"Uh-oh," said Darb. "Trolls don't like being hungry.

33
00:02:22.081 --> 00:02:25.941
Someone had better make some food for them before they get really mad."

34
00:02:25.942 --> 00:02:32.534
Shem quickly rubbed his hands together. A huge pot of steaming troll gruel appeared nearby.

35
00:02:32.535 --> 00:02:36.429
Both trolls let out howls of delight and ran to it.

36
00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:40.301
"Good." Vig sounded relieved. He glanced at Fala.

37
00:02:40.302 --> 00:02:45.797
"Does this mean all the trolls are free of Morb's influence, or just those two?"

38
00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:52.233
"My talisman should work on any trolls that are closer to it than to Morb's talisman," Fala replied.

39
00:02:52.234 --> 00:02:55.566
"That's amazing!" Perda whispered.

40
00:02:55.567 --> 00:03:00.012
"It'll be a lot easier to sneak into the palace now," said Zann.

41
00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:07.975
"With a little luck, we can find the dungeon and free the prisoners before Morb even realizes we're there," Vig said.

42
00:03:07.976 --> 00:03:12.729
"Maybe we can defeat Morb if we have help from all those powerful Reds."

43
00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:16.447
"Should we zap ourselves there?" Shem asked.

44
00:03:16.448 --> 00:03:20.390
"We'd better not," Fala said, looking at Zann and his friends.

45
00:03:20.391 --> 00:03:25.045
"Morb may still be tracking these kids, so they shouldn't use magic.

46
00:03:25.046 --> 00:03:29.390
Besides, we should save our energy in case we need it once we're in the palace."

47
00:03:29.391 --> 00:03:32.381
"Good point," Vig said. "Let's walk."

48
00:03:32.382 --> 00:03:35.432
It took about twenty minutes to reach the palace.

49
00:03:35.433 --> 00:03:41.544
On the way the group passed several more trolls, who were all busy eating or looking for food.

50
00:03:41.545 --> 00:03:44.878
None of them paid any attention to Gliss and Zann's red hair.

51
00:03:44.879 --> 00:03:49.303
When the group arrived at the palace courtyard, Zann didn't see any trolls.

52
00:03:49.304 --> 00:03:55.244
"I wonder if Morb has realized his trolls aren't working for him anymore," he commented.

53
00:03:55.245 --> 00:04:00.741
"I hope not." Fala frowned. "If he has, he might put up a Shield spell.

54
00:04:00.742 --> 00:04:03.765
That would make our task much more difficult."

55
00:04:03.766 --> 00:04:09.692
Zann didn't see a glowing green wall around the palace, or a wall of any other color either.

56
00:04:09.693 --> 00:04:13.232
"Can Shield spells be invisible?" Zann asked.

57
00:04:13.233 --> 00:04:18.110
"Yes," Gliss told him. "Weren't you paying attention when we learned that in class?"

58
00:04:18.111 --> 00:04:24.825
"There's only one way to test for a Shield spell," Vig declared, stepping toward the palace entrance.

59
00:04:24.826 --> 00:04:31.151
The others hurried after him, ducking behind some shrubs as Vig continued on his way toward the entrance.

60
00:04:31.152 --> 00:04:35.522
Zann saw him take a deep breath and then step across the threshold.

61
00:04:35.523 --> 00:04:39.643
A second later Vig poked his head back out and waved to the group.

62
00:04:39.644 --> 00:04:43.067
"No Shield spell!" Shem whispered to the others.

63
00:04:43.068 --> 00:04:48.290
The rest of the group followed Vig inside. They all paused in the entrance hall.

64
00:04:48.291 --> 00:04:50.739
"That was easy," said Perda.

65
00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:56.109
Zann was about to agree when he heard a strange squishing sound to his right.

66
00:04:56.110 --> 00:05:01.466
He turned to look and saw a purple, jellylike blob oozing toward them.

67
00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:06.124
"Uh-oh," said Zann. "Morb might not have put up a Shield spell.

68
00:05:06.125 --> 00:05:08.985
But it looks like he did leave a guard."

69
00:05:08.986 --> 00:05:12.611
"What is that thing?" Perda cried.

70
00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:17.677
"I don't know," Fala said. "I've never seen anything like it before."

71
00:05:17.678 --> 00:05:20.082
One of the rebels pulled out her sword.

72
00:05:20.083 --> 00:05:24.673
"Careful," Vig warned her. "We don't know what this thing might do."

73
00:05:24.674 --> 00:05:27.952
The woman reached out and poked the blob with her sword.

74
00:05:27.953 --> 00:05:35.064
Everyone gasped as the blob wrenched the sword from her hand and began absorbing it with a loud sucking sound.

75
00:05:35.065 --> 00:05:37.667
Zann could see the blob growing bigger.

76
00:05:37.668 --> 00:05:41.975
Grabbing the weapon, the woman tried to pull it back out, but it was no use.

77
00:05:41.976 --> 00:05:45.788
Her hand was getting dangerously close to the purple mass.

78
00:05:45.789 --> 00:05:48.219
"Let go!" Zann shouted.

79
00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:52.197
The woman released the sword and then jumped back as the blob lunged at her.

80
00:05:52.198 --> 00:06:00.032
Everyone took a step back as the blob oozed closer.

